  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobilising Civil Society against GBV - Khwendo Kor (KK)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Khwendo Kor is a women-led CSO headed by a famous rights activist. It adds significant value with a deep understanding of local gender contexts. In addressing the key rights&#x2019; deficits, empowerment of women and girls, social cohesion, promotion of civic space, community resilience and disaster risk management will be mainstreamed across the thematic areas. It will be implemented in selected Union Councils (UCs) in Umerkot and Sanghar districts in Sindh province.</narrative>
  </description>
